---
import { ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-cta">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span>
      <h2>下一条消息，也可以是工作的下一步。</h2>
      <p>让团队成员、AI 助理、项目和任务，在同一个协作空间里相遇。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-mint" href="https://chat.chaitin.net/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      进入即应 <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" />
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <a class="brand brand-light" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} aria-label="即应官网首页">
      <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.webp`} width="34" height="34" alt="" />
      <span>即应</span>
    </a>
    <p>有事即应，茉莉来帮你。</p>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}privacy/`}>隐私说明</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/duke-yeah/MagicChat" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      <span>© {year}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
